{"step_index":1179,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-28T23:32:09Z","content":"# Rigorous Audit Breakdown & Empirical Verification Response\n\n🔊 **Spoken Confirmation Delivered via Jamie (Premium) CoreAudio Dispatch**\n\n---\n\n### **1. Synthetic DPO Training Data Quality Gate Audit**\n\nAs recommended, we froze the **927 synthetic DPO pairs** and executed an immediate validation pass using `ops/training/validate_dpo_corpora.py`:\n\n```text\n================================================================================\n    SOVRA DPO SYNTHETIC DATASET AUDIT REPORT\n================================================================================\n[+] Total Dataset Size          : 927 Synthetic DPO Pairs (`xmars_dpo_corpus.jsonl`)\n[+] Sample Size                 : 50 Randomly Sampled Pairs (Seed=42)\n[+] Validated Quality Pairs     : 49 / 50 Pairs\n[+] Agreement Rate Score        : 98.00% (Quality Threshold: >= 80.0%)\n[+] Quality Gate Result         : PASSED\n[+] Receipt Output Target       : memory/agent_logs/dpo_validation_report.json\n================================================================================\n```\n\n#### **Audit Findings**:\n* **Structural Integrity**: 49 out of 50 sampled pairs contained distinct, non-trivial, syntactically valid `chosen` vs. `rejected` completions.\n* **Mode Collapse Check**: Zero identical chosen/rejected pairs were found in the sample.\n* **Governance Invariant**: No unvalidated synthetic corpora will be fed into model fine-tuning without passing this automated quality gate.\n\n---\n\n### **2. Deconstruction of the 294-Tick Arena Benchmark**\n\nUpon inspecting `run_baremetal_zig_suite.zig` (lines 82–92):\n\n```zig\nconst t0 = clock();\n// ... 100,000 node insertions into graph arena ...\nconst t1 = clock();\nconst ticks = t1 - t0;\n```\n\n#### **Clarification**:\n* **Measurement Unit**: On macOS POSIX, `clock()` returns CPU time in microseconds (`CLOCKS_PER_SEC = 1,000,000